msgid "The constructed query is not runnable - it would fail the query builder''s validation, so it cannot be visualized or saved. This usually means a field reference is missing its type or names a column that does not exist, or an aggregation/window function (e.g. `offset`) was placed in `expressions:` (custom columns) where it is not allowed - move it to `aggregation:` or `order-by:`. Schema validation details: {0}"
